assets/products/source-photos/manifest.json
tasks/source-photo-audit-report.md
tasks/source-photo-shoot-list.md

# The product registry and its dossier projections are byte-compared by
# scripts/sync_product_registry.py --check; the registry is sha256-pinned in
# assets/products/manifest.json. The root logo-registry.json is a symlink to it.
/logo-registry.json
wordpress-theme/skyyrose-flagship/data/logo-registry.json
wordpress-theme/skyyrose-flagship/data/dossiers/*.md

# Byte-stable or externally managed trees that lint-staged never formats
# (lint-staged.config.mjs isByteStableOrManaged). Listed here too so edit-time
# formatting (editor / PostToolUse prettier hooks) agrees with commit time.
plugins/fashion-theme-team/
Comfy/receipts/
Comfy/quarantine/
skyyrose/elite_studio/assets/golden/*/placement.md

# Built minified theme assets (both themes) are byte-compared against a fresh
# build (check:assets / freshness-guard); prettier must never rewrite them.
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css

# Machine-managed OpenWolf stores. buglog.json is written by the wolf-memory MCP
# server's serializer (one entry layout, byte-stable); prettier collapses its arrays,
# after which every bug_log call flips the file back — 1,600+ lines of churn per
# commit. anatomy.md is regenerated by the anatomy scanner in its own layout.
.wolf/buglog.json
.wolf/anatomy.md
